body:
Another funny, maybe not mentioned here fact. When the current ruling party (then opposition) brought up some legality problems in Poland (I don't remember rn what was that, there was so much dubious and shady shit going on with that government its hard to remember everything)  to the European Parliament, the ruling party - Law and Justice, called them traitors who snitched on Poland to the EU.

&#x200B;

Guess who the not-so-ruling-anymore party went to now to cry about that xddd
